      "title": "Numbers computed for this episode",
      "publisher": "This project",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-11-06T01:11:14Z",
      "excerpt": "Relative Rayleigh scattering strength scales with 1/wavelength^4. Using 450 nm blue, 530 nm green and 675 nm red against red: blue 5.06, green 2.63, red 1.00. Path through a flat atmosphere is secant of the zenith angle: sun 60 degrees up 1.15, sun 30 degrees up 2.00, sun 10 degrees up 5.76.",
      "locator": "tools/numbers.md, computed with node 24.21.0",
